---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
---

<Layout title="Philosophy - Rewild" description="You were built for this - the philosophy behind Rewild.">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <Nav />

  <!-- Philosophy -->
  <section class="bg-white pt-36 pb-24 md:pt-44 md:pb-36">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12">
      <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs tracking-[0.25em] uppercase font-light text-forest/60 hover:text-forest transition-colors duration-200 mb-12">
        <span>←</span><span>Home</span>
      </a>
      <div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24 items-stretch">
        <div class="md:order-1 min-h-[400px]">
          <img
            src="/images/waterflow.webp"
            alt="Connected with the earth"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover object-center"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="md:order-2">
          <h1 class="font-display font-light text-4xl md:text-5xl text-forest mb-10 leading-tight">
            You were built for this
          </h1>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-forest font-light leading-relaxed text-[1.08rem]">
            <p>
              Step into nature and within minutes, cortisol begins to drop, the mind quietens, and the nervous system shifts into repair mode.
            </p>
            <p>
              Time in nature does more than relax you, it restores you.
            </p>
            <p>
              Picture yourself being in a forest.
            </p>
            <p>
              The sweet scent of the earth.
            </p>
            <p>
              The sound of leaves all around.
            </p>
            <p>
              It feels good, doesn't it?
            </p>
            <p>
              Being among trees lowers anxiety, sharpens memory, and boosts immunity.
            </p>
            <p>
              Water revitalises, sunlight regulates sleep, and being outdoors actually makes social interactions easier.
            </p>
            <p>
              Your body carries millions of years of adaptation to this environment - to move freely, rest deeply and feel fiercely alive.
            </p>
            <p>
              As distant as it may seem, that capacity is still within you.
            </p>
            <p>
              Rewild is about waking it up.
            </p>
            <p>
              By reminding you of <em>your</em> nature.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <footer class="bg-forest text-white py-14 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center gap-2 text-center">
      <p class="text-white/30 text-xs font-light">© 2025 Rewild</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

</Layout>
